  {
   "name": "window_close_self_id",
   "comment": "At W committed frames, bank stability = held_n/committed_n onto the repairable axis (target 1.0); post_repair iff a fault is already open (the gate's re-measure). Bump epoch and reset the counters IMMEDIATELY (single-fire; the folded increment paused at the cap).",
